# In a Limited game a sideboard holds any number of basic lands (Magic Tournament Rules): one The Holodeck plays from
# outside the game leaves another outside, as one a wish brings in does (CR 400.11b). Bot1 plays a Forest from outside
# the game as its land play, and its sideboard is still Forest; Bot2's is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Holodeck
Black Lotus x3
Island x16

[Basic Lands Outside]
Forest

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
? Bot1.Sideboard = Forest
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.The Holodeck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Sideboard.Forest.Play
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = The Holodeck; Forest
Bot1.Sideboard = Forest
Bot2.Sideboard = Forest
